Success and Status doesn’t erase a criminal past. A prominent franchise owner with a lengthy criminal record and a final order of removal was taken into custody in Islamorada, FL.
The Cuban national’s list of offenses includes felony drug offenses, grand theft, larceny, resisting arrest, and DUI. He is currently pending deportation proceedings.

